{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T13:11:14.242Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1630","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1630","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1626+pm-gh1630+pm-gh1633","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1630","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1630","lineage:pm-5t33or","lineage:pm-n7rr","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T13:11:14.242Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence: reproduced on the pre-fix build d9c4a0bca. A 4-test item's --only-last receipt printed all 4 tests[] rows, and the selection block was repeated as warning linked_test_selection:only-last=last;selected=1;skipped=3;indexes=4. projectTestResult now returns runSelection.selected as tests[] whenever a selector skipped at least one test. count keeps the full stored total, selection keeps the 1-based indexes and skipped count, and a new optional tests_omitted {count, restore_with: 'pm test <id> --list'} names the full-collection read. Unselected runs and --list are unchanged. The redundant selection warning is removed. Its only consumer was the unit assertion that is now replaced, and empty_linked_test_selection is untouched. Measured on a 58-test fleet-shaped item, --only-last: TOON 8662 to 2212 bytes (-74%), JSON 18826 to 2695 bytes (-86%), pre-fix build vs this build on the same tracker. The SDK runTest result and CLI --json are covered in test-command.spec.ts for match, only-index and only-last, plus --list restore and the unselected run. MCP pm_test forwards through the same runTest result. SDK surface acknowledged for the optional TestResult.tests_omitted. Follow-up observation, not in scope: the remaining ~1.2 KB of a selective receipt is mostly execution_context, which repeats sandbox paths even when no context mismatch occurred."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T13:11:14.242Z"}],"before_hash":"669ecb765c8aa9d198fdf7b4f53edf08197763394bfc8352825b8d646015bf4b","after_hash":"fcb682c9300f349d3241c1a4d618acb82ab243fe2d989794d676faff607b8354","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"a8a80a952d2b7fba5ba63e641982a5b19fd3d31caf2a95d7fe428de0d76bce74"}
